1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:02,680
(Bernadette:)Knock-knock.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,710
Who is there?

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,280
(Sheldon:)Hugh.
Hugh who?

4
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:08,250
(Sheldon:)Hugh people need to
listen to me.

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,720
(Sheldon:)It's time to get
in line for the movie.

6
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,570
(Sheldon:)And that's how you tell
a knock-knock joke.

7
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:26,900
(Sheldon:)Under normal circumstances
I'd say, "I told you so."

8
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,070
(Sheldon:)But as I have told you so

9
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,840
(Sheldon:)with such vehemence
and frequency already,

10
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,670
(Sheldon:)the phrase has lost all meaning.

11
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:36,340
(Sheldon:)Therefore, I will be
replacing it with the phrase:

12
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,630
"I informed you thusly."

13
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:41,510
(Howard:)Ooh. Can't wait
for that to start.

14
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,770
(Sheldon:)I informed you thusly.

15
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:47,350
(Raj:)Eight for 28.

16
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:51,140
(Sheldon:)This is where we could have been
if we hadn't stopped for dinner.

17
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:53,310
(Sheldon:)This is where we could have been

18
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:55,630
(Sheldon:)if Koothrappali
hadn't ordered dessert.

19
00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:57,780
(Raj:)Well I earned it, dude,
I ate all my broccoli.

20
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:02,950
(Sheldon:)And here's where we are.
The runts in a large litter.

